{"id":"P062-2","subject":"P","unit":"P062","unitTitle":"2024 하반기 · 24.11.02 한국전력기술 (스카우트)","set":2,"questions":[{"id":"P062-S2-Q01","number":1,"question":"24.11.02 한국전력기술 (스카우트) · 객관식 26번","searchText":" 26\n\n110V의 전압을 단권 변압기를 이용하여 220V로\n\n승압시킬 때, 부하용량이 100kVA였다. 단권 변압기의\n\n자기용량은 몇 kVA인가?\n\n\n① 10          ② 20\n\n③ 40          ④ 50\n\n⑤ 100","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.11.02 한국전력기술 (스카우트)","originalId":"2024h2-e21-m26","number":26},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e21-m26-q.webp","width":678,"height":603},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e21-m26-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1620}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P062-S2-Q02","number":2,"question":"24.11.02 한국전력기술 (스카우트) · 객관식 27번","searchText":" 27\n\n비돌극형 동기발전기 한 상의 기전력을 6000V, 단자\n\n전압을 5800V, 동기 리액턴스를 10Ω, 부하각을 30°\n\n라 할 때, 한 상의 출력은 몇 kW인가?\n\n\n① 870         ② 960\n\n③ 1250         ④ 1620\n\n⑤ 1740","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.11.02 한국전력기술 (스카우트)","originalId":"2024h2-e21-m27","number":27},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e21-m27-q.webp","width":678,"height":668},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e21-m27-e1.webp","width":696,"height":262},{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e21-m27-e2.webp","width":678,"height":988}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P062-S2-Q03","number":3,"question":"24.11.02 한국전력기술 (스카우트) · 객관식 28번","searchText":" 28\n\n4극, 60Hz의 3상 유도전동기가 1692rpm 운전할 때,\n\n회전자 전류의 주파수는 몇 Hz인가?\n\n\n\n\n① 2.4          ② 3\n\n③ 3.6          ④ 4\n\n⑤ 4.8","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.11.02 한국전력기술 (스카우트)","originalId":"2024h2-e21-m28","number":28},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e21-m28-q.webp","width":696,"height":611},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e21-m28-e1.webp","width":678,"height":896}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P062-S2-Q04","number":4,"question":"24.11.02 한국전력기술 (스카우트) · 객관식 29번","searchText":" 29\n\n4극 60Hz, 200V 단상 유도전동기가 있다. 전류가\n\n25A , 효율이 80, 역률이 0.8일 때, 유도전동기의\n출력은 몇 kW인가?\n\n\n① 2.6          ② 3.2\n\n③ 4.0          ④ 4.8\n\n⑤ 5.0","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.11.02 한국전력기술 (스카우트)","originalId":"2024h2-e21-m29","number":29},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e21-m29-q.webp","width":696,"height":603},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e21-m29-e1.webp","width":696,"height":483}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P062-S2-Q05","number":5,"question":"24.11.02 한국전력기술 (스카우트) · 객관식 30번","searchText":" 30\n\n광속이 4000lm, 감광보상율 1.5, 조명률이 0.5인 전등을\n200m인 사무실에 30개 설치할 때, 평균 조도는 몇\n\nlx인가?\n\n\n① 400         ② 300\n\n③ 200         ④ 100\n\n⑤ 50","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.11.02 한국전력기술 (스카우트)","originalId":"2024h2-e21-m30","number":30},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e21-m30-q.webp","width":696,"height":669},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e21-m30-e1.webp","width":696,"height":797}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P062-S2-Q06","number":6,"question":"24.11.02 한국전력기술 (스카우트) · 객관식 31번","searchText":" 31\n\n가로 9m, 세로 6m, 천장 높이 3m인 방의 실지수는\n\n얼마인가?\n\n\n① 1.2          ② 1.3\n\n③ 1.5          ④ 1.7\n\n⑤ 1.8","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.11.02 한국전력기술 (스카우트)","originalId":"2024h2-e21-m31","number":31},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e21-m31-q.webp","width":678,"height":483},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e21-m31-e1.webp","width":696,"height":603}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P062-S2-Q07","number":7,"question":"24.11.02 한국전력기술 (스카우트) · 객관식 32번","searchText":" 32\n\n다음 그림과 같이 대칭 3상 교류발전기의 상이 Ω\n을 통하여 지락되었을 때 흐르는 지락전류 A 는?\n(단, , , 은 영상, 정상, 역상 임피던스Ω이다.)\n\n\n\n\n\n                            \n①            ② \n                            \n③            ④ \n          \n⑤","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.11.02 한국전력기술 (스카우트)","originalId":"2024h2-e21-m32","number":32},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e21-m32-q.webp","width":678,"height":942},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e21-m32-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1881},{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e21-m32-e2.webp","width":696,"height":1883}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P062-S2-Q08","number":8,"question":"24.11.02 한국전력기술 (스카우트) · 객관식 33번","searchText":" 33\n\n연축전지의 정격용량이 400Ah, 상시부하가 20kW,\n\n표준전압이 100V인 부동충전방식이 있다.\n\n이 부동충전방식의 충전기 2차 전류는 몇 A인가?\n\n\n① 200         ② 220\n\n③ 240         ④ 260\n\n⑤ 280","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.11.02 한국전력기술 (스카우트)","originalId":"2024h2-e21-m33","number":33},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e21-m33-q.webp","width":678,"height":458},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e21-m33-e1.webp","width":678,"height":815}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P062-S2-Q09","number":9,"question":"24.11.02 한국전력기술 (스카우트) · 객관식 34번","searchText":" 34\n\n납축전지의 공칭전압Vcell과 정격 방전률h은?\n\n\n\n       공칭전압        공칭용량\n\n ①          2                  5\n\n ②          2                 10\n\n ③           1.2                 5\n\n ④           1.2                10\n\n ⑤           1.2                20","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.11.02 한국전력기술 (스카우트)","originalId":"2024h2-e21-m34","number":34},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e21-m34-q.webp","width":696,"height":707},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e21-m34-e1.webp","width":678,"height":756}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P062-S2-Q10","number":10,"question":"24.11.02 한국전력기술 (스카우트) · 객관식 35번","searchText":" 35\n\n4kW의 전열기를 사용하여 10°C의 물 16L를 96°C\n로 가열하기 위해 필요한 시간은 몇 min인가?\n\n(단, 효율은 0.8이다.)\n\n\n① 30          ② 45\n\n③ 60          ④ 90\n\n⑤ 120","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.11.02 한국전력기술 (스카우트)","originalId":"2024h2-e21-m35","number":35},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e21-m35-q.webp","width":696,"height":643},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e21-m35-e1.webp","width":678,"height":312},{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e21-m35-e2.webp","width":696,"height":843}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P062-S2-Q11","number":11,"question":"24.11.02 한국전력기술 (스카우트) · 객관식 36번","searchText":" 36\n\nBLDC 센서리스 제어방식에 대한 내용으로 옳지 않은 것은?\n\n\n① 모터의 회전속도를 직접 측정하지 않고 추정한다.\n\n② 역기전력을 이용하여 회전자의 위치를 측정한다.\n\n③ 인코더, 케이블 및 커넥터가 필요하지 않다.\n\n④ 고속회전시에 서보모터가 필수적이며, 안정적인 제어가\n\n  가능하다.\n\n⑤ 홀센서를 사용하지 않아 비용이 절감된다.","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.11.02 한국전력기술 (스카우트)","originalId":"2024h2-e21-m36","number":36},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e21-m36-q.webp","width":696,"height":533},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e21-m36-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1041}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P062-S2-Q12","number":12,"question":"24.11.02 한국전력기술 (스카우트) · 객관식 37번","searchText":" 37\n\n서보모터의 필수적인 요소에 해당되지 않는 것은?\n\n\n① 드라이버       ② 컨트롤러\n\n③ 피드백 센서      ④ 회전관성\n\n⑤ 전원공급장치","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.11.02 한국전력기술 (스카우트)","originalId":"2024h2-e21-m37","number":37},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e21-m37-q.webp","width":678,"height":603},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e21-m37-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1410}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P062-S2-Q13","number":13,"question":"24.11.02 한국전력기술 (스카우트) · 객관식 38번","searchText":" 38\n\n아크용접시 발생하는 플라즈마에 대한 설명으로 틀린 것은?\n\n\n① 국부적인 극성을 가진다.\n\n② 전도성 기체로 이루어져 있다.\n\n③ 온도변화에도 일정한 성질이 있다.\n\n④ 이온화된 기체이다.\n\n⑤ 용접 물질에 따라 플라즈마 품질이 달라진다.","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.11.02 한국전력기술 (스카우트)","originalId":"2024h2-e21-m38","number":38},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e21-m38-q.webp","width":678,"height":683},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e21-m38-e1.webp","width":678,"height":472}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P062-S2-Q14","number":14,"question":"24.11.02 한국전력기술 (스카우트) · 객관식 39번","searchText":" 39\n\nMIG용접과 TIG용접에 대한 설명으로 틀린것은?\n\n\n① MIG용접은 소모성 용접이다.\n\n② TIG용접은 비소모성 용접이다.\n\n③ MIG용접은 보호가스로 이산화탄소 가스를 사용한다.\n\n④ TIG용접은 아르곤 가스를 사용한다.\n\n⑤ MIG용접은 TIG용접보다 용접속도가 빠르다.","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.11.02 한국전력기술 (스카우트)","originalId":"2024h2-e21-m39","number":39},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e21-m39-q.webp","width":678,"height":597},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e21-m39-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1881}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]}]}
